      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "I will admit, the ape is not to my tastes. He is brash, boorish and a poor tactician. His insistence in appearing behind a video screen is tiresome - he forgets I know all his little secrets."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "サルは私の好みに合わないことは認めます。 彼は頭が痛く、貧乏で、戦術家だ。 ビデオ画面の後ろに現れることへの彼の主張は退屈です - 彼は私が彼の小さな秘密をすべて知っていることを忘れています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "And yet, he's an invaluable ally. I may not agree with his methods, but his goals are sound. And he has the ear of the self-styled lord, Thornwing. Strange times make for strange bedfellows. It's not like anything is conventional these days."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "でも彼はとても貴重な味方です 彼のやり方には賛成できないかもしれないが、彼の目標は正しい。 そして、彼は自己スタイル主、ソーンウィングの耳を持っています。 奇妙な時間は、奇妙なベッド仲間にとってのものです。 昨今の習慣とは違います。"
    }
